# Sovereign Command Center (SCC) Implementation Plan

The objective is to create a premium, futuristic management interface for the Sovereign AI Ecosystem, enabling both local PC control and remote iPhone monitoring.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Mobile Access**: To access the Command Center on your iPhone, we will use a **Local Tunnel** (e.g., Cloudflare Tunnel or `localtunnel`). This requires a one-time setup on your PC.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Command Center Backend]

#### [NEW] [scc_server.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/scc_server.ts)
A lightweight Socket.io + Express server that:
- Watches `swarm/logs/*.log` and `src/data/*.json` for changes.
- Streams real-time telemetry to the dashboard.
- Proxies commands (Maintenance, Restart, Config) to the swarm processes.

---

### [Command Center Frontend]

#### [NEW] [AdminSovereign.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/AdminSovereign.tsx)
A dedicated futuristic dashboard page:
- **Visuals**: HSL-based dark mode, glassmorphism, and neon telemetry.
- **Features**: Live revenue chart, swarm health matrix, and "God Mode" kill-switch.
- **PWA Support**: Manifest and Service Worker for iPhone "Add to Home Screen" support.

---

### [Unified Launch]

#### [MODIFY] [ecosystem.sovereign.config.cjs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/ecosystem.sovereign.config.cjs)
Add the `scc-server` as a persistence layer for the UI.

#### [MODIFY] [launch_swarm_v3.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/launch_swarm_v3.bat)
Update to launch the SCC and provide the mobile access tunnel command.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npm run scc:test`: Verify WebSocket connectivity and data streaming.

### Manual Verification
- Open `http://localhost:5173/admin/sovereign` and verify real-time log updates.
- Toggle Maintenance Mode from the UI and verify that agents shut down via terminal logs.
